{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Yes [Bb]I’ll go stepping too my honey [Bb]I’ll go stepping [F]too
[F]I’ll lock the door, [F]put out the cat And I’ll go stepping [Bb]too
Now every time you come in late And we begin to fight
